[h1]Esc Closes Letters[/h1]
A RimWorld mod that lets you close letter popups with the [u]Cancel[/u] and [u]Accept[/u] keys

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Dismiss letter popups with the [u]Cancel[/u] key or the [u]Accept[/u] key. You can toggle each one independently in the mod settings.
[*]Eligible dismiss options are vanilla-style choices such as [u]OK[/u], [u]Close[/u], [u]Postpone[/u], and [u]Reject[/u] (labels match your game language). Choose which types apply in the mod settings.
[list]
[*][u]OK[/u] and [u]Close[/u] are enabled by default; the others are off by default.
[/list]
[/list]

[h2]Requirements[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2009463077]Harmony[/url]
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Should be compatible with most mods.

[h2]Save compatibility[/h2]
This mod does not modify save files, so you can add or remove it at any time.

